# Stack (`typescript`)

Node 24.22.0 (`nvm use`), pnpm 12.11.2 (corepack). Run from repo root.

## Commands

- Test: `pnpm test` (watch: `pnpm test:watch`)
- Lint/format: `pnpm lint` / `pnpm format` (Biome)
- Typecheck: `pnpm typecheck` (core, node, web projects)
- All gates: `pnpm check` (lint + typecheck + test)
- Dev: `pnpm dev [dir]` · Serve built app: `pnpm start [dir]` · Scan: `pnpm scan <dir>`
- Build: `pnpm build` (→ `dist/web/`)

## Layout

- Source: `src/core`, `src/scanner`, `src/layout`, `src/source-editing` (pure core); `src/server`, `src/cli` (Node); `src/web` (React + D3)
- Tests: `*.test.ts` next to code; Node-only helpers in `src/test-support/`
- Fixtures: `fixtures/<name>/`, golden `expected.graph.json`

## Do

- Keep pure core free of Node APIs: Web-standard APIs only; I/O via `FileSource`.
- Let D3 own the graph SVG subtree; React owns panels and the outer `<svg>`.
- Derive types from zod schemas (`z.infer`).
- Use `MemoryFileSource` in core tests; add a golden file when a fixture changes.
- Store fixture agent config under renamed names (`dot-cursor/`, `AGENTS.fixture.md`) and load it via `loadFixture` / `materializeFixture` (`src/test-support/fixtures.ts`).

## Don't

- Import `node:*`, `hono`, `react`, `d3`, `src/server`, `src/web`, or `src/cli` from pure core folders.
- Import `node:*` from `src/web`.
- Reformat or normalize files under `fixtures/` (CRLF/BOM must stay byte-exact).
- Put real secrets in fixtures — use `SENTINEL-NOT-A-SECRET-*`.
- Invent scripts or folder layouts not present in the project.
- Commit `.env` or secrets.
